Package: fuck-ads
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: FuckAds maintainers <maintainers@example.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: systemd, adduser
Homepage: https://github.com/PankajKrana/fuck-ads
Description: System-wide ad and tracker blocking
 FuckAds blocks advertising and tracking domains for the whole system with a
 local filtering DNS resolver (DNS-over-HTTPS upstreams) and provides browser
 extensions for in-page filtering. No telemetry; statistics stay local.
 .
 After installation, run "sudo fuck-ads enable" to turn protection on.
